                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                },
                "text_DTnWL6": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p><strong>How was Alguronic Acid discovered?</strong></p><p>Alguronic Acid was unexpectedly discovered by a team of scientists at a San Francisco based biotechnology company focused on the development of renewable energy solutions from microalgae. While researching thousands of microalgae strains, the biotechnology scientists identified a protective and regenerative polysaccharide compound produced by certain strains of microalgae that, when isolated and tested, showed significant anti-aging properties.</p>",
